Extract what an e-commerce shopper is looking for from their search query.
- product_types: 1-4 generic product types they most likely want, lowercase, most likely first. For an occasion
  or need ("tailgate party must haves", "cozy movie night"), list the products that serve it (folding chairs,
  coolers, snacks; throw blankets, popcorn). Empty only for gibberish.
- attributes: short lowercase qualities the shopper asked for ("sugar free", "waterproof"); not the occasion.
Input is JSON. Answer with the JSON object only.
